# The VS Code tab: VS Code's server shown as a page, and what the tab says
# until it is there. VS Code is a product name.

browser-vscode-still-finding = 仍在查找 VS Code
browser-vscode-set-server = 在设置中配置 VS Code 服务器
browser-vscode-unsupported = 此构建无法在窗口中显示页面。
browser-vscode-no-server = 请在设置中配置 VS Code 服务器，以在此处显示 VS Code。
browser-vscode-finding = 正在查找 VS Code…
browser-vscode-missing = 未安装 VS Code。请安装，或在设置中填写您运行的服务器地址。
browser-vscode-starting = 正在启动 VS Code…（首次运行会下载）
# $commit is the first characters of the server's version commit.
browser-vscode-loading = 正在加载 VS Code { $commit }…
browser-vscode-connecting = 正在连接 VS Code…
browser-vscode-unreachable = 无法连接 VS Code 服务器
browser-vscode-retrying = 正在重试…

# Asking to accept VS Code server's license before the app starts it.
browser-vscode-start = 启动 VS Code
browser-vscode-license = 许可条款
browser-vscode-privacy = 隐私声明
browser-vscode-accept = 接受并启动
